OL,3,GNEWSAKarl Bushby to complete 28-year
OL,4,Aglobal trek
OL,5,
OL,6,FKarl Bushby left Chile in November 1998
OL,7,Fwith the aim of walking an unbroken
OL,8,Fpath back to his home in Hull
OL,10,FThe adventurer is returning to his
OL,11,Fchildhood home to end his 28-year
OL,12,Fjourney
OL,14,FTo date, he has crossed four
OL,15,Fcontinents, swum the English Channel
OL,16,Fand walked more than 31,000 miles
OL,17,F(58,000km)
OL,19,FFamily, friends and supporters are
OL,20,Fwaiting for him at the finish line
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
